OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FPiano music from the New Ross
OL,12,     FPiano Festival and Emilie Mayer's
OL,13,     F5th Symphony performed by the BBC
OL,14,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra and Anja
OL,15,     FBihlmaier.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,17,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,18,     F4/5. Donald Macleod meets the
OL,19,     Ffriends (and foes) of composer
OL,20,     FClara Schumann. Today, two close
OL,21,     Ffriends who supported Clara
OL,22,     Fthrough difficult times.
